### 1. GET ALL ITEMS as admin (should succeed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET ALL ITEMS as user (should succeed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 3. GET ALL ITEMS as superadmin (should succeed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin
Accept: application/json

### 4. GET specific book as user (should succeed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/1
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 5. Access /hello/superadmin as superadmin (should succeed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/hello/superadmin
Authorization: Basic superadmin superadmin
Accept: application/json

### 6. Access /hello/superadmin as user (should fail – no permission)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/hello/superadmin
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 7. Access /hello/user as admin (should succeed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/hello/user
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 8. Access /index.html as user (should succeed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/index.html
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json

### 9. Access /hello/admin as admin (should succeed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic admin admin
Accept: application/json

### 10. Access /hello/admin as user (should fail – no permission)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/hello/admin
Authorization: Basic user user
Accept: application/json
